{
  "name": "ListVDCRoles",
  "summary": "查询角色列表",
  "tags": "VDC",
  "productshort": "ManageOneSCHCS",
  "region_id": "ap-southeast-3",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/vdc/v3.0/roles": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询角色列表",
        "x-resource": "角色管理",
        "description": "查询角色列表。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X GET \"https://access{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/roles\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|240次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|20次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "ListVDCRoles",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,机机账号权限,VDC管理员权限,vdc只读权限,代维管理员权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": 1000,
            "description": "限制每页显示的条目数量,默认为1000。"
          },
          {
            "name": "start",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": 0,
            "description": "分页查询的起始位置,取值范围为0到2147483647,默认从0开始。"
          },
          {
            "name": "tenant_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "VDC用户需传入租户或VDC的ID,代维管理员用户需传入代维租户或VDC的ID,运营管理员等其他用户可以不用此参数查询。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_key",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": "id",
            "description": "排序字段,默认为id。",
            "enum": [
              "display_name",
              "id"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "query",
            "default": "asc",
            "enum": [
              "asc",
              "desc"
            ],
            "description": "排序方向,取值范围asc,desc,默认为asc。"
          },
          {
            "name": "display_name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "显示名称,1到128位。",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "tenant_name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "租户名称,长度为1-64位。",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "获取VDC角色列表成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CustomRolesList"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "total": 1,
                "roles": [
                  {
                    "id": "1c335bfbe8db42b7bc14ba684c8c07c8",
                    "name": "xxx",
                    "description": "xxx",
                    "role_type": "1",
                    "display_name": "xxx",
                    "is_default": "false",
                    "status": "available",
                    "vdc_id": "3712227b-070c-4ca1-b5ba-20ef6011490a",
                    "catalog": null,
                    "tenant_name": "xxx",
                    "flag": null,
                    "policy": null,
                    "third_roles": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数错误。"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "接口认证失败。"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "URL鉴权失败。"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "rest接口未找到。"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "默认ServiceException异常码,应用内部错误。"
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "N",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET: https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.0/roles",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "",
        "x-request-examples-1": ""
      }
    }
